<title>HUNGARY: Csopak to buy own shares.</title>
<headline>Csopak to buy own shares.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian holding company Csopak Szovetkezeti Rt said on Friday it decided to buy own shares worth a nominal 50,000 million forints.</p>
<p>On the Budapest Stock Exchange Csopak shares closed at 1,900 forints on February 12, the last day when they were traded.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
